{"id":"52e708105e8ce779","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-untyped-truth.md","title":"自应用句法与原书无类型理论分类","display":"df-untyped-truth — 自应用句法与原书无类型理论分类","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-untyped-truth","aliases":["91-df-untyped-truth"],"display":"df-untyped-truth — 自应用句法与原书无类型理论分类","depends_on":["[[91-df-typed-truth]]","[[91-df-language-with-truth]]","[[91-df-numeral]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-untyped-truth"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-untyped-truth</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-untyped-truth — 自应用句法与原书无类型理论分类"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"00a1e20ba65f1f5a\" href=\"?note=00a1e20ba65f1f5a\" title=\"91-df-typed-truth\">91-df-typed-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"97fe560478d37064\" href=\"?note=97fe560478d37064\" title=\"91-df-language-with-truth\">91-df-language-with-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"822ef14bbd4e020d\" href=\"?note=822ef14bbd4e020d\" title=\"91-df-numeral\">91-df-numeral</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T=\\mathcal L_0\\cup\\{T\\}\">\\(\\mathcal L_T=\\mathcal L_0\\cup\\{T\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 为一元谓词，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(S\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TypedTh}\">\\(\\operatorname{TypedTh}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"00a1e20ba65f1f5a\" href=\"?note=00a1e20ba65f1f5a\" title=\"91-df-typed-truth\">91-df-typed-truth</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SelfApplicable}(T,\\mathcal L_T)\">\\(\\operatorname{SelfApplicable}(T,\\mathcal L_T)\\)</span> 是句法性质；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TypeFreeTh}(S)\">\\(\\operatorname{TypeFreeTh}(S)\\)</span> 是理论性质；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Untyped\\text{-}Truth}\">\\(\\mathrm{Untyped\\text{-}Truth}\\)</span> 仅为旧句法接口的别名。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}untyped\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{SelfApplicable}(T,\\mathcal L_T)\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\;\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}untyped\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{SelfApplicable}(T,\\mathcal L_T)\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\;\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Untyped\\text{-}Truth}(T,\\mathcal L_T)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{SelfApplicable}(T,\\mathcal L_T),\n\\qquad\\operatorname{TypeFreeTh}(S)\\coloneqq\\neg\\operatorname{TypedTh}(S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Untyped\\text{-}Truth}(T,\\mathcal L_T)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{SelfApplicable}(T,\\mathcal L_T),\n\\qquad\\operatorname{TypeFreeTh}(S)\\coloneqq\\neg\\operatorname{TypedTh}(S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书“type-free”指第二项，不等同于第一项。TB、UTB、CT 的语言也能形成自应用真理原子，却被原书判为有类型，因为它们不规定含真理句的外延。\n无类型理论可以通过编码量化的组合子句、规则或其他受控公理限制含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 句的真理行为；这不授权全语言透明双条件。原书 PA+COMP 是无类型但保守的例子，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6f3411be790eb1c9\" href=\"?note=6f3411be790eb1c9\" title=\"91-thm-untyped-nonconservative\">91-thm-untyped-nonconservative</a>。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 10.1，印刷页 129–131，PDF 页 140–142。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-typed-truth","status":"resolved","id":"00a1e20ba65f1f5a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-typed-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-language-with-truth","status":"resolved","id":"97fe560478d37064","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-language-with-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"822ef14bbd4e020d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-typed-truth","status":"resolved","id":"00a1e20ba65f1f5a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal L_T=\\mathcal L_0\\cup\\{T\\}$，$T$ 为一元谓词，$S\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}$；$\\operatorname{TypedTh}$ 见 [[91-df-typed-truth]]。","embed":false},{"target":"91-thm-untyped-nonconservative","status":"resolved","id":"6f3411be790eb1c9","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"原书“type-free”指第二项，不等同于第一项。TB、UTB、CT 的语言也能形成自应用真理原子，却被原书判为有类型，因为它们不规定含真理句的外延。\n无类型理论可以通过编码量化的组合子句、规则或其他受控公理限制含 $T$ 句的真理行为；这不授权全语言透明双条件。原书 PA+COMP 是无类型但保守的例子，见 [[91-thm-untyped-nonconservative]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L_T=\\mathcal L_0\\cup\\{T\\}","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"S\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TypedTh}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SelfApplicable}(T,\\mathcal L_T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TypeFreeTh}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Untyped\\text{-}Truth}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}untyped\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{SelfApplicable}(T,\\mathcal L_T)\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\;\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Untyped\\text{-}Truth}(T,\\mathcal L_T)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{SelfApplicable}(T,\\mathcal L_T),\n\\qquad\\operatorname{TypeFreeTh}(S)\\coloneqq\\neg\\operatorname{TypedTh}(S).","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false}],"bytes":1709,"backlinks":[{"id":"41d9670193aa08f6","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6f3411be790eb1c9","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-untyped-truth]]"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-122","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-untyped-truth]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-119","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-coded-syntax.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conjunction-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-conservative-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conservativity-proof.md]]\n[[91-df-consistency-predicate.md]]\n[[91-df-continuity.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-truth.md]]\n[[91-